    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "note": "axross-markdown's linkify extra. Read all 4 modules: regexes, the IANA TLD list and Unicode class data (_ucre_data.py, generated; 2.2.0 vendors what uc-micro-py gave, so no dependency) - no I/O, no network, no exec/eval, no process; the only odd line is upstream's setattr(LinkifyIt, 'func', ...) for user schemas. No finding, no YARA hit, no hook, no binary. Package identical to the v2.2.0 tag on github.com/tsutsu3/linkify-it-py; attestation (tsutsu3/linkify-it-py github-ci.yml, env prod) verifies."
